## Instructions
When this skill applies:
- Start from the privacy pattern's context, problem, and solution.
- Explain what personal data, user expectation, or disclosure risk the pattern addresses.
- Give concrete design guidance before broad privacy background.
- Call out consequences and tradeoffs when applying the pattern.
- Do not invent requirements that are not supported by the source material.

